00:03:17.194 --> 00:03:20.930
Risk-taking and boldness is the essence of
transformation.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:23.571
That moment that I picked up the phone
that

00:03:23.571 --> 00:03:27.050
I made that decision that transformed my
